"Yan awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ nibiti awọn aṣayan Itọsọna ko yẹ ki o ṣiṣẹ. Fun "
"apẹẹrẹ, yan \"Awọn ọja (ọja)\" lati pa gallery lori awọn oju-iwe ọja "
"WooCommerce nigba ti o n pa a ṣiṣẹ ni ibomiiran."

