msgid "How to use: WordPress \"Enlarge on Click\""
msgstr "Bawo ni lati lo: WordPress \"Faagun lori Tite\""

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6315
msgid ""
"WordPress has a built-in \"Enlarge on Click\" feature for images. Here's "
"how to enable it:"
msgstr ""
"WordPress ni ẹya \"Faagun lori Tite\" ti a kọ sinu fun awọn aworan. Eyi ni "
"bi a ṣe le mu ṣiṣẹ:"

