msgstr "Nínú àtọka ìtọ́sọ́nà block, yí pada sí \"Ipele Giga\"."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6351
msgid "Add <code>ml-lightbox-enabled</code> to \"Additional CSS class(es)\"."
msgstr "Fi <code>ml-lightbox-enabled</code> kún \"CSS class(ès) afikun\"."

